CM_ BO_ 1568 "10 Hz + on change (>= 20 ms apart; a freshness-forced OFF at once). DLC 4 = frame layout 2. In shadow, ACTIVE / WOULD_ON = would light; OUT_DRIVE is always 0. A DLC-8 0x620 is frame layout 1 (routes before 2026-11-01): read it with blr/tools/blr_layout1.dbc.";
CM_ SG_ 1568 OUT_DRIVE "PB10 as applied (RELAY_CMD).";
CM_ SG_ 1568 WOULD_ON "The decided output (virt).";
CM_ SG_ 1568 REQUEST "BRAKE_LIGHTS && COMPUTER_BRAKE_REQUEST && COMPUTER_BRAKE > 0 of the last valid 0x1FA; 0 if stale.";
CM_ SG_ 1568 CMD_FRESH "A valid 0x1FA within 150 ms.";
CM_ SG_ 1568 EXT_SINK "Coil line LOW and lamp feed HIGH with the 0x17C pedal bit fresh and 0: something other than the pedal sinks the coil.";
CM_ SG_ 1568 BLR_SEQ "0-15 rolling, one per 0x620 sent: loss detection. Not a Honda COUNTER on purpose. Layout 2 only (layout 1: bits 56-59). A DLC-8 0x620 is frame layout 1 (routes before 2026-11-01): read it with blr/tools/blr_layout1.dbc, where bits 8-11 are the sense zones.";
CM_ SG_ 1568 ADC_OK "The sense ADC is delivering sets with VDDA in range; 0 forces the output off. Layout 2 only (layout 1: bit 52). A DLC-8 0x620 is frame layout 1 (routes before 2026-11-01): read it with blr/tools/blr_layout1.dbc, where bit 7 is EDGE_DEFERRED (nearly always 0).";
CM_ SG_ 1568 PIN_MISMATCH "PB10 reads back other than it was driven. Layout 2 only (layout 1: bit 51). A DLC-8 0x620 is frame layout 1 (routes before 2026-11-01): read it with blr/tools/blr_layout1.dbc, where bit 13 is PEDAL_CAN.";
CM_ SG_ 1568 CAN_DEGRADED "Error-passive now, or a received frame lost in the last 500 ms: the output is forced off.";
CM_ SG_ 1569 VBAT_SNS_MV "After the reverse-polarity diode D2, uncorrected (about 0.2-0.35 V below J1-3).";
CM_ SG_ 1571 FAULTS_EVER "OR of 0x620 bits 16-23 seen this power cycle.";
CM_ SG_ 1571 ON_EDGES "Counts WOULD_ON edges (also in shadow).";
CM_ SG_ 1575 GIT_HASH "Path-scoped BLR commit, little-endian (the 0x707 convention).";
CM_ SG_ 1575 FRAME_LAYOUT "2 since 2026-11-01; 1 before (blr/tools/blr_layout1.dbc).";

VAL_ 1568 STATE 0 "INIT" 1 "IDLE" 2 "ACTIVE" 3 "FAULT" 4 "LATCHED" 7 "KNOCK" ;
VAL_ 1568 LATCH_REASON 0 "NONE" 1 "U4" 2 "FEEDBACK" 3 "CLOCK" 4 "PIN_STUCK_HIGH" ;
VAL_ 1570 RESET_CAUSE 0 "POWER" 1 "PIN" 2 "SOFTWARE" 3 "IWDG" 4 "WWDG" 5 "OBL" 6 "LPWR" 7 "NONE" ;
VAL_ 1570 LAST_EXC 0 "NONE" 1 "HARDFAULT" 2 "CSS" 3 "BENCH_KILL" ;
VAL_ 1575 VARIANT 1 "BENCH" 2 "SHADOW" 3 "LIVE" ;
